<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76945" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰλί̆ν-ορσος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>backwards, back</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς ὅτε τίς τε δράκοντα ἰδὼν
					παλίνορσος ἀπέστη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					3.33
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Emp.
				35.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγε νῆα . . π. ἐς Ἑλλάδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					1.416
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. φορή</span>
			<i>retrograde</i> movement, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SA</u>
				2.5
			</span></i>; <i>recurrent</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἣν ἡ νοῦσος π. ὀφθῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>CD</u>
					1.5
				</span></i>
			: neut. as Adv., <i>back again,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				7.608
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Eutolm.
			</span></i>): 
				Att.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰλίνορρον</span></b> , <i>with a
				backward wrench</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				1179
			</span></i>. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ορσος</span> prob. 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρρος</span>
			, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλιμπυγηδόν</span>.)</div>
